# Findings reviewed and accepted. Each is driven by an input that the caller sets per environment.

# AKS public API server: restricted via api_server_authorized_ip_ranges or private_cluster.
# The module emits a `check` warning when neither is set; environments/dev sets authorized ranges.
AZU-0041
AZU-0065

# Customer-managed keys are an opt-in compliance requirement, not a baseline. Platform-managed
# keys plus infrastructure (double) encryption are used by default.
AZU-0060

# State account logging is done through Azure Monitor diagnostic settings (log_analytics_workspace
# input), not classic Storage Analytics logging, which this check looks for.
AZU-0057

# Connection throttling targets password brute-force; the server is private and Entra-only by default.
AZU-0021

# environments/dev opens 80/443 on the node subnet for Service LB ingress; prod uses a private cluster.
AZU-0047
